Preserve the paused player turn and every serialized string attribute on restore.

A clock-mode campaign saved from player input is paused midway through CheckMeks.
Resume that input before advancing time, without replaying previous actors,
movement or the already-consumed confusion decision.  Deployment autosaves
have no control mode yet and must still receive ordinary initialization.

The compact gear reader must preserve empty and duplicate serialized string
attributes, rather than interpreting them as mutation/deletion commands.

